 far-right group back in  November if you're telling me there's a  horrible people horrible racist people  horrible I would certainly apologize if  you'd like me to do that now President  Trump is expected to be interviewed by  special counsel mullah at some point  here in the next few weeks and earlier  the president told reporters that he is  quote looking forward to it Anthony  Errol Barnett at the White House thanks  Harold
 

